{"root":"pli/ms","translators":["sujato"],"title":"The Ascetic Truthful’s Conduct","html":"<article id='cp28'><header><ul><li class='division'><span class='root'>Cariyāpiṭaka </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>The Conduct Leading to Buddhahood </span></li>\n<li><span class='root'>Yudhañjayavagga </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>The Chapter With Yudhañjaya </span></li>\n<li><span class='root'>Saccapāramī 2 </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>The Perfection of Truth (2nd) </span></li></ul>\n<h1 class='sutta-title'><span class='root'>Saccatāpasacariya </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>The Ascetic Truthful’s Conduct </span></h1></header>\n<blockquote class='gatha'><p><span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>“Punāparaṁ yadā homi, </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>“Then again when I was </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>Tāpaso saccasavhayo; </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>an ascetic known as Truthful, </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>Saccena lokaṁ pālesiṁ, </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>I protected the world with my truth, </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>Samaggaṁ janamakāsahan”ti. </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>uniting the people.” </span></span></p></blockquote>\n<p class='endsutta'><span class='root'>Saccatāpasacariyaṁ aṭṭhamaṁ. </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'></span></p></article>"}
